	["Share my collection"] = "Partager ma collection",
	["Copy this code (Ctrl+C, Cmd+C on a Mac), then paste it on the website of Curator: it holds your character, your collection, your collector level and the history of your finest cards."] = "Copie ce code (Ctrl+C, Cmd+C sur Mac), puis colle-le sur le site de Curator : il contient ton personnage, ta collection, ton niveau de collectionneur et l'histoire de tes plus belles cartes.",
