	-- (1.7.0) a save edited outside the game: Curator suspended until the collection starts over
	["Curator suspended"] = "Curator suspendu",
	["Curator is suspended: no more boosters, no more cards, no more trades. To play again, start over: your whole collection is reset (cards, boosters, level, achievements)."] = "Curator est suspendu : plus de boosters, plus de cartes, plus d'échanges. Pour rejouer, repars de zéro : toute ta collection est réinitialisée (cartes, boosters, niveau, hauts faits).",
