	-- 0.23.1: the presence shared with the author
	["/curator presence: share your presence with the author of Curator, or not"] = "/curator presence：是否向 Curator 的作者分享你的在线状态",
	["Your presence is not shared with the author of Curator (/curator presence to share it)."] = "你的在线状态未分享给 Curator 的作者（输入 /curator presence 分享）。",
	["Your presence is shared with the author of Curator (/curator presence to stop)."] = "你的在线状态已分享给 Curator 的作者（输入 /curator presence 停止）。",
	-- 1.1.0: the boosters in a small window, the guided tour of the album
	["/curator compact: open the boosters in a small window you can move, or in full screen"] = "/curator compact：在可移动的小窗口或全屏中打开补充包",
	["/curator tour: a guided tour of the album"] = "/curator tour：收藏册导览",
	["A tour of the album and its pages."] = "介绍收藏册及其各个页面。",
	["Achievements give points and collector titles. Their rewards wait for you here."] = "成就会带来点数和收藏家头衔。它们的奖励在这里等你领取。",
	["All your boosters, album by album, and the booster of the place you are in. Levels and quests also give boosters to choose: put them in the album you want. The (i) of a booster tells its odds."] = "按收藏册列出的全部补充包，以及你所在地点的补充包。等级和任务还会给予自选补充包：把它们放进你想要的收藏册。补充包上的 (i) 会显示其概率。",
	["Back to the boosters in full screen."] = "回到全屏显示补充包。",
	["Boosters: full screen."] = "补充包：全屏显示。",
	["Boosters: in a small window. Drag its edges to move it, the mouse wheel over it changes its size."] = "补充包：在小窗口中打开。拖动窗口边缘可以移动它，在窗口上滚动鼠标滚轮可以改变大小。",
	["Drag the edges of the window to move it, the mouse wheel over it changes its size."] = "拖动窗口边缘可以移动它，在窗口上滚动鼠标滚轮可以改变大小。",
	["Each zone, dungeon and raid has its album, with a card for each of its creatures. Click a card you have to see it up close. Click a missing one to look for it: your guild will see it."] = "每个区域、地下城和团队副本都有自己的收藏册，其中每种生物都有一张卡牌。点击你拥有的卡牌可以近距离查看。点击缺少的卡牌即可寻找它：你的公会会看到。",
	["Earn boosters"] = "获得补充包",
	["Every album, by level, and how far you are in each. Click one to open it."] = "按等级列出的所有收藏册，以及你在每本中的进度。点击一本即可打开。",
	["Full screen"] = "全屏",
	["Guided tour"] = "导览",
	["Next"] = "下一步",
	["Open your boosters in a small window you can move, to keep an eye on the world while you walk."] = "在可移动的小窗口中打开补充包，边走边留意周围的世界。",
	["Previous"] = "上一步",
	["Quests of the day, the week and the month, of the dungeons, the raids and PvP. They give experience and boosters."] = "每日、每周、每月任务，以及地下城、团队副本和 PvP 任务。它们会给予经验和补充包。",
	["Skip"] = "跳过",
	["Small window"] = "小窗口",
	["Ten copies of a rarity make a card of the next one. Write an exchange contract with the copies you have to spare."] = "同一稀有度的十张卡牌可换得一张更高稀有度的卡牌。用多余的卡牌写一份交换契约吧。",
	["The arrows go to the previous and the next album. The bar shows how far this one is: click it to show only the cards you have. The gems count each rarity: click one to show only its cards."] = "箭头可前往上一本和下一本收藏册。进度条显示本册的进度：点击它只显示你拥有的卡牌。宝石统计每种稀有度：点击其中一个只显示该稀有度的卡牌。",
	["This button (or /curator tour) plays the tour again. A tip: the button at the top right of the booster scene opens your boosters in a small window, to keep an eye on the world while you walk."] = "这个按钮（或 /curator tour）可以重新播放导览。小提示：打开补充包时右上角的按钮可以在小窗口中打开，边走边留意周围的世界。",
	["Turn the albums"] = "翻阅收藏册",
	["Your album"] = "你的收藏册",
	["Your collector level and the rewards of its track, your showcase and your finest pulls. Other players can see it."] = "你的收藏家等级与奖励路线、展示柜和荣誉榜。其他玩家也能看到。",
	["Your turn!"] = "轮到你了！",
