	["Click: your boosters. Shift-drag: move the bar. /curator bar: hide it."] = "点击：你的补充包。Shift+拖动：移动进度条。/curator bar：隐藏。",
	["Dungeon or raid: a boss"] = "地下城或团队副本：一个首领",
	["Dungeon or raid: a creature"] = "地下城或团队副本：一个生物",
	["Dungeon or raid: an elite"] = "地下城或团队副本：一个精英",
	["Dungeon or raid: its last boss"] = "地下城或团队副本：最终首领",
	["Each time it is full: a booster of the album of the place where you are."] = "每次填满：获得你所在地点的收藏册补充包一个。",
	["Fill the booster bar (above your experience bar) where an album lives: defeat creatures that give experience, complete quests and their objectives, discover places, gain levels; in a dungeon or a raid, defeat its creatures and its bosses. Each time it is full: a booster of the album of the place."] = "在收藏册所在的地方填满补充包进度条（位于经验条上方）：击败能获得经验的生物、完成任务及其目标、发现地点、升级；在地下城或团队副本中，击败其中的生物和首领。每次填满：获得该地点收藏册的补充包一个。",
	["Here are your boosters for this album and the booster bar, also shown over your experience bar. It fills where an album lives: creatures that give experience, quests and their objectives, new places, levels. Full, it gives a booster of the album of the place. The button on the right opens one."] = "这里是本册的补充包和补充包进度条，进度条也显示在你的经验条上方。它在收藏册所在的地方填充：能获得经验的生物、任务及其目标、新地点、等级。填满后获得该地点收藏册的补充包一个。右边的按钮可以打开一个。",
	["limit of the day reached"] = "已达今日上限",
	["no album here"] = "此处无收藏册",
	["No album lives here: the bar does not fill (the daily quests of the collector still fill it)."] = "这里没有收藏册：进度条不会填充（收藏家的每日任务仍然可以填充它）。",
	["Nothing is sure: your copies to spare make better cards with the contracts."] = "没有任何保底：多余的卡牌可以通过契约换成更好的卡牌。",
	["Open all"] = "全部打开",
	["Open all (%d)"] = "全部打开（%d）",
	["Put it in the album you want: the Boosters tab."] = "把它放进你想要的收藏册：补充包标签页。",
	["Stop"] = "停止",
