	["too low for your level"] = "对你的等级来说太低",
	["What fills it:"] = "填充方式：",
	["Your trades with other players, and the wanted cards: those you look for, and those you can give."] = "你与其他玩家的交换，以及寻找的卡牌：你在找的，和你能给出的。",
	-- 1.2.1: the boosters kept from before 1.2 taken away
	["The boosters kept from before 1.2 are taken away (%d): they came far too easily. New ones come with the booster bar, above your experience bar."] = "1.2 之前保留的补充包已被收回（%d 个）：它们来得太容易了。新的补充包通过经验条上方的补充包进度条获得。",
	-- 1.3.0: the card in the hand, the entrances again, the finishes forged everywhere
	["/curator test [album | dungeon | raid] [mythic | legendary | epic | rare] [thunderforged | titanforged]: a preview booster with that card (nothing is kept)"] = "/curator test [收藏册 | dungeon | raid] [mythic | legendary | epic | rare] [thunderforged | titanforged]：含有该卡牌的预览补充包（不会保留任何东西）",
	["A contract of titanforged cards."] = "一份泰坦造物卡牌的契约。",
	["A guide only: every trade is free. A card counts as rare as a booster makes it: a common 1, an uncommon 3, a rare 10, an epic 60, a legendary 300, a mythic 1,500; a thunderforged copy 25 times more, a titanforged one 100 times more; a booster what it holds on average."] = "仅供参考：每次交换都是自由的。卡牌按其在补充包中的稀有度计算：普通 1，优秀 3，精良 10，史诗 60，传说 300，神话 1500；雷霆铸造的卡牌是 25 倍，泰坦造物的卡牌是 100 倍；补充包按其平均内容计算。",
	["A legendary card or better with a finish (thunderforged, titanforged), in a booster."] = "在补充包中获得特殊版本（雷霆铸造、泰坦造物）的传说或更好卡牌。",
	["A titanforged mythic card."] = "一张泰坦造物的神话卡牌。",
	["Cards that have a thunderforged copy."] = "拥有雷霆铸造副本的卡牌。",
	["Cards that have a titanforged copy."] = "拥有泰坦造物副本的卡牌。",
	["Different thunderforged cards: %d"] = "不同的雷霆铸造卡牌：%d",
	["Different titanforged cards: %d"] = "不同的泰坦造物卡牌：%d",
	["Drag to turn the card · Mouse wheel to zoom"] = "拖动以转动卡牌 · 鼠标滚轮缩放",
	["Drag to turn the card · Mouse wheel to zoom · Right-click to close"] = "拖动以转动卡牌 · 鼠标滚轮缩放 · 右键关闭",
	["Forged by the titans"] = "泰坦锻造",
	["Lord of thunder"] = "雷霆之主",
	["Myth of the titans"] = "泰坦神话",
	["No big pull yet: your legendary and mythic cards, your titanforged cards and your thunderforged epic cards will come here."] = "还没有大收获：你的传说和神话卡牌、泰坦造物卡牌以及雷霆铸造的史诗卡牌都会出现在这里。",
	["Replay its entrance"] = "重播登场动画",
	["Storm chaser"] = "追风逐雷",
	["Struck by lightning"] = "雷霆一击",
	["The album keeps the finest copy of each card (titanforged, then thunderforged); only the others go into contracts."] = "收藏册会为每张卡牌保留最好的一张（泰坦造物，其次雷霆铸造）；只有其余的卡牌会进入契约。",
	["Thunderforged and titanforged cards only go with cards of their own finish, and give a card of that finish."] = "雷霆铸造与泰坦造物卡牌只能与相同版本的卡牌一起交换，并换得该版本的卡牌。",
	["Thunderforged cards"] = "雷霆铸造卡牌",
	["Titanforged cards"] = "泰坦造物卡牌",
	["Titanforged contract"] = "泰坦造物契约",
	["Touched by the titans"] = "泰坦之触",
	["Two cards with a finish (thunderforged, titanforged) in the same booster."] = "同一个补充包中出现两张特殊版本卡牌（雷霆铸造、泰坦造物）。",
	["Your legendary and mythic cards, your titanforged cards and your thunderforged epic cards."] = "你的传说和神话卡牌、泰坦造物卡牌以及雷霆铸造的史诗卡牌。",
	["Hoard is now Curator: your collection came along. After your next logout, you can delete the folder Hoard of your addons."] = "Hoard 现已更名为 Curator：你的收藏已随之迁移。下次登出后，你可以删除插件中的 Hoard 文件夹。",
	["The Hoard of before is still installed: replace its folder (Interface\\AddOns\\Hoard) with the one that comes with Curator, then reload. Your collection will then move to Curator."] = "旧版 Hoard 仍已安装：请用 Curator 附带的文件夹替换它的文件夹（Interface\\AddOns\\Hoard），然后重载界面。之后你的收藏会迁移到 Curator。",
	["Curator already has a collection of its own: the one of Hoard stays where it is."] = "Curator 已经有自己的收藏：Hoard 的收藏保持原样。",
	["First clear! Bonus booster"] = "首次通关！奖励补充包",
	["Mandatory update: Curator %s is out and your version (%s) no longer works."] = "强制更新：Curator %s 已发布，你的版本（%s）已无法使用。",
	["Mandatory update: your version of Curator (%s) no longer works."] = "强制更新：你的 Curator 版本（%s）已无法使用。",
	["Mandatory update"] = "强制更新",
	["Curator %s is out"] = "Curator %s 已发布",
	["A new version of Curator is out"] = "Curator 已发布新版本",
	["This update is mandatory: your version (%s) no longer works. Update Curator, then come back: your collection is waiting for you, nothing is lost."] = "此更新为强制更新：你的版本（%s）已无法使用。请更新 Curator 后再回来：你的收藏一直在等你，不会丢失任何东西。",
	["This update is mandatory: your version (%s) no longer works. Get the new one in the beta channel: your collection is waiting for you, nothing is lost."] = "此更新为强制更新：你的版本（%s）已无法使用。请到内测频道获取新版本：你的收藏一直在等你，不会丢失任何东西。",
	["Next dungeon booster: %d%%"] = "下一个地下城补充包：%d%%",
