	["The first time each of your characters completes a dungeon or a raid: a booster of it, besides."] = "你的每个角色首次通关一个地下城或团队副本时：额外获得该地的补充包一个。",
	["Each time it is full: a booster of the album chosen for the place (its own by default), 5 a day at most."] = "每次填满：获得为该地选择的收藏册（默认为其自身）补充包一个，每天最多5个。",
