	-- 1.1.0: the boosters in a small window, the guided tour of the album
	["/curator compact: open the boosters in a small window you can move, or in full screen"] = "/curator compact：在可移動的小視窗或全螢幕中開啟補充包",
	["/curator tour: a guided tour of the album"] = "/curator tour：收藏冊導覽",
	["A tour of the album and its pages."] = "介紹收藏冊及其各個頁面。",
	["Achievements give points and collector titles. Their rewards wait for you here."] = "成就會帶來點數和收藏家頭銜。它們的獎勵在這裡等你領取。",
	["All your boosters, album by album, and the booster of the place you are in. Levels and quests also give boosters to choose: put them in the album you want. The (i) of a booster tells its odds."] = "按收藏冊列出的全部補充包，以及你所在地點的補充包。等級和任務還會給予自選補充包：把它們放進你想要的收藏冊。補充包上的 (i) 會顯示其機率。",
	["Back to the boosters in full screen."] = "回到全螢幕顯示補充包。",
	["Boosters: full screen."] = "補充包：全螢幕顯示。",
	["Boosters: in a small window. Drag its edges to move it, the mouse wheel over it changes its size."] = "補充包：在小視窗中開啟。拖曳視窗邊緣可以移動它，在視窗上滾動滑鼠滾輪可以改變大小。",
	["Drag the edges of the window to move it, the mouse wheel over it changes its size."] = "拖曳視窗邊緣可以移動它，在視窗上滾動滑鼠滾輪可以改變大小。",
	["Each zone, dungeon and raid has its album, with a card for each of its creatures. Click a card you have to see it up close. Click a missing one to look for it: your guild will see it."] = "每個區域、地城和團隊副本都有自己的收藏冊，其中每種生物都有一張卡牌。點擊你擁有的卡牌可以近距離查看。點擊缺少的卡牌即可尋找它：你的公會會看到。",
	["Earn boosters"] = "獲得補充包",
	["Every album, by level, and how far you are in each. Click one to open it."] = "按等級列出的所有收藏冊，以及你在每本中的進度。點擊一本即可開啟。",
	["Full screen"] = "全螢幕",
	["Guided tour"] = "導覽",
	["Next"] = "下一步",
	["Open your boosters in a small window you can move, to keep an eye on the world while you walk."] = "在可移動的小視窗中開啟補充包，邊走邊留意周圍的世界。",
	["Previous"] = "上一步",
	["Quests of the day, the week and the month, of the dungeons, the raids and PvP. They give experience and boosters."] = "每日、每週、每月任務，以及地城、團隊副本和 PvP 任務。它們會給予經驗和補充包。",
	["Skip"] = "跳過",
	["Small window"] = "小視窗",
	["Ten copies of a rarity make a card of the next one. Write an exchange contract with the copies you have to spare."] = "同一稀有度的十張卡牌可換得一張更高稀有度的卡牌。用多餘的卡牌寫一份交換契約吧。",
	["The arrows go to the previous and the next album. The bar shows how far this one is: click it to show only the cards you have. The gems count each rarity: click one to show only its cards."] = "箭頭可前往上一本和下一本收藏冊。進度條顯示本冊的進度：點擊它只顯示你擁有的卡牌。寶石統計每種稀有度：點擊其中一個只顯示該稀有度的卡牌。",
	["This button (or /curator tour) plays the tour again. A tip: the button at the top right of the booster scene opens your boosters in a small window, to keep an eye on the world while you walk."] = "這個按鈕（或 /curator tour）可以重新播放導覽。小提示：開啟補充包時右上角的按鈕可以在小視窗中開啟，邊走邊留意周圍的世界。",
	["Turn the albums"] = "翻閱收藏冊",
