	["Dungeon or raid: an elite"] = "地城或團隊副本：一個精英",
	["Dungeon or raid: its last boss"] = "地城或團隊副本：最終首領",
	["Each time it is full: a booster of the album of the place where you are."] = "每次填滿：獲得你所在地點的收藏冊補充包一個。",
	["Fill the booster bar (above your experience bar) where an album lives: defeat creatures that give experience, complete quests and their objectives, discover places, gain levels; in a dungeon or a raid, defeat its creatures and its bosses. Each time it is full: a booster of the album of the place."] = "在收藏冊所在的地方填滿補充包進度條（位於經驗條上方）：擊敗能獲得經驗的生物、完成任務及其目標、發現地點、升級；在地城或團隊副本中，擊敗其中的生物和首領。每次填滿：獲得該地點收藏冊的補充包一個。",
	["Here are your boosters for this album and the booster bar, also shown over your experience bar. It fills where an album lives: creatures that give experience, quests and their objectives, new places, levels. Full, it gives a booster of the album of the place. The button on the right opens one."] = "這裡是本冊的補充包和補充包進度條，進度條也顯示在你的經驗條上方。它在收藏冊所在的地方填充：能獲得經驗的生物、任務及其目標、新地點、等級。填滿後獲得該地點收藏冊的補充包一個。右邊的按鈕可以開啟一個。",
	["limit of the day reached"] = "已達今日上限",
	["no album here"] = "此處無收藏冊",
	["No album lives here: the bar does not fill (the daily quests of the collector still fill it)."] = "這裡沒有收藏冊：進度條不會填充（收藏家的每日任務仍然可以填充它）。",
	["Nothing is sure: your copies to spare make better cards with the contracts."] = "沒有任何保底：多餘的卡牌可以透過契約換成更好的卡牌。",
	["Open all"] = "全部開啟",
	["Open all (%d)"] = "全部開啟（%d）",
	["Put it in the album you want: the Boosters tab."] = "把它放進你想要的收藏冊：補充包標籤頁。",
	["Stop"] = "停止",
	["The next booster goes to: %s"] = "下一個補充包歸於：%s",
	["too low for your level"] = "對你的等級來說太低",
	["What fills it:"] = "填充方式：",
	["Your trades with other players, and the wanted cards: those you look for, and those you can give."] = "你與其他玩家的交換，以及尋找的卡牌：你在找的，和你能給出的。",
	-- 1.2.1: the boosters kept from before 1.2 taken away
	["The boosters kept from before 1.2 are taken away (%d): they came far too easily. New ones come with the booster bar, above your experience bar."] = "1.2 之前保留的補充包已被收回（%d 個）：它們來得太容易了。新的補充包透過經驗條上方的補充包進度條獲得。",
	-- 1.3.0: the card in the hand, the entrances again, the finishes forged everywhere
	["/curator test [album | dungeon | raid] [mythic | legendary | epic | rare] [thunderforged | titanforged]: a preview booster with that card (nothing is kept)"] = "/curator test [收藏冊 | dungeon | raid] [mythic | legendary | epic | rare] [thunderforged | titanforged]：含有該卡牌的預覽補充包（不會保留任何東西）",
	["A contract of titanforged cards."] = "一份泰坦鑄造卡牌的契約。",
	["A guide only: every trade is free. A card counts as rare as a booster makes it: a common 1, an uncommon 3, a rare 10, an epic 60, a legendary 300, a mythic 1,500; a thunderforged copy 25 times more, a titanforged one 100 times more; a booster what it holds on average."] = "僅供參考：每次交換都是自由的。卡牌按其在補充包中的稀有度計算：普通 1，優秀 3，精良 10，史詩 60，傳說 300，神話 1500；雷霆鑄造的卡牌是 25 倍，泰坦鑄造的卡牌是 100 倍；補充包按其平均內容計算。",
	["A legendary card or better with a finish (thunderforged, titanforged), in a booster."] = "在補充包中獲得特殊版本（雷霆鑄造、泰坦鑄造）的傳說或更好卡牌。",
	["A titanforged mythic card."] = "一張泰坦鑄造的神話卡牌。",
	["Cards that have a thunderforged copy."] = "擁有雷霆鑄造副本的卡牌。",
	["Cards that have a titanforged copy."] = "擁有泰坦鑄造副本的卡牌。",
	["Different thunderforged cards: %d"] = "不同的雷霆鑄造卡牌：%d",
	["Different titanforged cards: %d"] = "不同的泰坦鑄造卡牌：%d",
	["Drag to turn the card · Mouse wheel to zoom"] = "拖曳以轉動卡牌 · 滑鼠滾輪縮放",
	["Drag to turn the card · Mouse wheel to zoom · Right-click to close"] = "拖曳以轉動卡牌 · 滑鼠滾輪縮放 · 右鍵關閉",
	["Forged by the titans"] = "泰坦鍛造",
	["Lord of thunder"] = "雷霆之主",
	["Myth of the titans"] = "泰坦神話",
	["No big pull yet: your legendary and mythic cards, your titanforged cards and your thunderforged epic cards will come here."] = "還沒有大收穫：你的傳說和神話卡牌、泰坦鑄造卡牌以及雷霆鑄造的史詩卡牌都會出現在這裡。",
	["Replay its entrance"] = "重播登場動畫",
	["Storm chaser"] = "追風逐雷",
	["Struck by lightning"] = "雷霆一擊",
	["The album keeps the finest copy of each card (titanforged, then thunderforged); only the others go into contracts."] = "收藏冊會為每張卡牌保留最好的一張（泰坦鑄造，其次雷霆鑄造）；只有其餘的卡牌會進入契約。",
	["Thunderforged and titanforged cards only go with cards of their own finish, and give a card of that finish."] = "雷霆鑄造與泰坦鑄造卡牌只能與相同版本的卡牌一起交換，並換得該版本的卡牌。",
	["Thunderforged cards"] = "雷霆鑄造卡牌",
	["Titanforged cards"] = "泰坦鑄造卡牌",
	["Titanforged contract"] = "泰坦鑄造契約",
	["Touched by the titans"] = "泰坦之觸",
	["Two cards with a finish (thunderforged, titanforged) in the same booster."] = "同一個補充包中出現兩張特殊版本卡牌（雷霆鑄造、泰坦鑄造）。",
	["Your legendary and mythic cards, your titanforged cards and your thunderforged epic cards."] = "你的傳說和神話卡牌、泰坦鑄造卡牌以及雷霆鑄造的史詩卡牌。",
	["Hoard is now Curator: your collection came along. After your next logout, you can delete the folder Hoard of your addons."] = "Hoard 現已更名為 Curator：你的收藏已隨之遷移。下次登出後，你可以刪除插件中的 Hoard 資料夾。",
	["The Hoard of before is still installed: replace its folder (Interface\\AddOns\\Hoard) with the one that comes with Curator, then reload. Your collection will then move to Curator."] = "舊版 Hoard 仍已安裝：請用 Curator 附帶的資料夾取代它的資料夾（Interface\\AddOns\\Hoard），然後重新載入介面。之後你的收藏會遷移到 Curator。",
	["Curator already has a collection of its own: the one of Hoard stays where it is."] = "Curator 已經有自己的收藏：Hoard 的收藏保持原樣。",
	["First clear! Bonus booster"] = "首次通關！獎勵補充包",
	["Mandatory update: Curator %s is out and your version (%s) no longer works."] = "強制更新：Curator %s 已發布，你的版本（%s）已無法使用。",
	["Mandatory update: your version of Curator (%s) no longer works."] = "強制更新：你的 Curator 版本（%s）已無法使用。",
	["Mandatory update"] = "強制更新",
	["Curator %s is out"] = "Curator %s 已發布",
	["A new version of Curator is out"] = "Curator 已發布新版本",
	["This update is mandatory: your version (%s) no longer works. Update Curator, then come back: your collection is waiting for you, nothing is lost."] = "此更新為強制更新：你的版本（%s）已無法使用。請更新 Curator 後再回來：你的收藏一直在等你，不會遺失任何東西。",
	["This update is mandatory: your version (%s) no longer works. Get the new one in the beta channel: your collection is waiting for you, nothing is lost."] = "此更新為強制更新：你的版本（%s）已無法使用。請到封測頻道取得新版本：你的收藏一直在等你，不會遺失任何東西。",
	["Next dungeon booster: %d%%"] = "下一個地城補充包：%d%%",
	["Next raid booster: %d%%"] = "下一個團隊副本補充包：%d%%",
	["Dungeon and raid bar"] = "地城和團隊副本進度條",
	["It fills in the dungeons and the raids."] = "在地城和團隊副本中填充。",
	["It fills outside the dungeons and the raids."] = "在地城和團隊副本之外填充。",
	["The first time each of your characters completes a dungeon or a raid: a booster of it, besides."] = "你的每個角色首次通關一個地城或團隊副本時：額外獲得該地的補充包一個。",
	["Each time it is full: a booster of the album chosen for the place (its own by default), 5 a day at most."] = "每次填滿：獲得為該地選擇的收藏冊（預設為其自身）補充包一個，每天最多5個。",
