	["Tailor-Made Contract"] = "訂製契約",
	["Once a day, you choose the album the card of a contract comes from, among the albums of its cards."] = "每天一次，你可以從契約中各卡牌所屬的收藏冊裡，選擇新卡牌來自哪本收藏冊。",
